                                                "sense_id": "39ffcf2a-8f60-3e96-af38-137b3ace9b6a",
                                                "text": "He's usually in a good mood — the operative word there being \"usually\". Today was a disaster."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16e4c527-130f-304f-ae8b-16c22463e083",
